<p><em>Last updated: July 2026</em></p>

<p>
  Sanghi Autoplex Pvt. Ltd., operating as Planet Toyota ("we", "our", "us"), respects your privacy.
  This policy explains how we collect, use, and protect information when you interact with us —
  whether visiting our showroom, contacting us by phone or email, using our website or digital
  tools, or engaging with our Google Business Profile.
</p>

<h2>Information We Collect</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Contact details you provide to us, such as name, phone number, and email address, when you enquire about a vehicle, book a service, or contact our team</li>
  <li>Vehicle-related information such as registration number, VIN, and service history, when you use our sales, service, or parts departments</li>
  <li>Feedback and reviews you choose to leave on our Google Business Profile or other public platforms</li>
  <li>Basic usage information if you interact with our digital tools (such as quotation requests or service booking forms)</li>
</ul>

<h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
<ul>
  <li>To respond to your enquiries, quotations, and service requests</li>
  <li>To process vehicle sales, service, and parts transactions</li>
  <li>To communicate with you about your vehicle, bookings, offers, or account with us</li>
  <li>To respond to reviews and feedback you leave publicly, in order to improve our service</li>
  <li>To comply with legal, regulatory, and manufacturer (Toyota Kirloskar Motor) requirements</li>
</ul>

<h2>How We Protect Your Information</h2>
<p>
  We take reasonable technical and organisational measures to protect personal information from
  unauthorised access, loss, or misuse. Access to customer data within our dealership is limited
  to authorised staff who require it to perform their roles.
</p>

<h2>Sharing of Information</h2>
<p>
  We do not sell your personal information. We may share necessary information with Toyota
  Kirloskar Motor Pvt. Ltd. and its authorised partners (such as finance and insurance partners)
  strictly for the purpose of completing your requested transaction, or as required by law.
</p>

<h2>Google Business Profile &amp; Reviews</h2>
<p>
  When you leave a review on our Google Business Profile, your review and our reply are publicly
  visible as governed by Google's own policies. We use this information only to respond to your
  feedback and improve our services — we do not use review content for any other purpose.
</p>

<h2>Your Rights</h2>
<p>
  You may contact us at any time to ask what information we hold about you, to request a
  correction, or to request that we stop contacting you for marketing purposes.
</p>

